<title>USA: Buffton says to record gain on sale.</title>
<headline>Buffton says to record gain on sale.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buffton Corp said Wednedsy that the sale of Current Technology Inc to Danaher Corp will sale will result in a $12.5 million or $1.63 per share gain during the third quarter ending June 30, to be reflected in discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The company announced the completion of the sale Wednesday.</p>
